## 🔐 Security Architecture

[ADAPT: Describe your defense-in-depth model]

**Encryption**:
- Data at Rest: AES-256-GCM (or equivalent)
- Data in Transit: TLS 1.3 minimum
- Secrets: Environment variables / secrets manager — NEVER in code

